{"id": "8dd0d359-dc83-4857-9fef-f036ee53f62f", "slug": "integration-section", "title": "Integration Section", "description": "Integration Built Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Integration Section\"\ndescription: \"Integration Built Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#60A5FA\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#EAB308\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Integration Section\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 2; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nIntegration Built Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nIntegration Built for engineers. Integrate effortlessly via our unified CLI or REST APIs. Omi drops into your existing CI/CD pipelines, bringing instant spatial logic to legacy applications without a full rewrite. API O…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Built for engineers.; API Orchestration; Real-Time Telemetry; Distributed Compute.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #60A5FA, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #EAB308, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Integration Section</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white min-h-screen relative overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-cyan-500/30 flex flex-col justify-center\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Layer with Progressive Blur & Light Effect -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center\">\n        <!-- Core light source -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-3/4 -translate-y-1/2 w-[80vw] h-[80vw] max-w-[800px] max-h-[800px] rounded-full bg-cyan-900/20 blur-[120px]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-3/4 -translate-y-1/2 w-[40vw] h-[40vw] max-w-[400px] max-h-[400px] rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 blur-[80px]\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Layered edge blur (Progressive Blur) at the bottom for depth -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-40 z-10\" style=\"mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, black 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, black 100%);\">\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full backdrop-blur-xl bg-[#050505]/40\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:px-12 lg:px-24 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-20 items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Left Column: Copy & Features -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-10 w-full max-w-xl\">\n\n            <!-- Header Section -->\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n                        <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-cyan-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-cyan-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(6,182,212,0.8)]\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-400 uppercase\">Integration</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.1]\">\n                    Built for engineers.\n                </h2>\n\n                <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-lg\">\n                    Integrate effortlessly via our unified CLI or REST APIs. Omi drops into your existing CI/CD pipelines, bringing instant spatial logic to legacy applications without a full rewrite.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Feature List -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 pt-4\">\n\n                <!-- Feature 1 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5 group cursor-default\">\n                    <div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:border-cyan-500/30 group-hover:bg-cyan-500/10 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-circle-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 pt-0.5\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-white\">API Orchestration</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">GraphQL and REST endpoints with sub-millisecond response guarantees.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Feature 2 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5 group cursor-default\">\n                    <div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:border-cyan-500/30 group-hover:bg-cyan-500/10 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stopwatch-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 pt-0.5\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-white\">Real-Time Telemetry</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">Native Prometheus/Grafana integration for instant visual observability.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Feature 3 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5 group cursor-default\">\n                    <div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:border-cyan-500/30 group-hover:bg-cyan-500/10 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 pt-0.5\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-white\">Distributed Compute</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">Deploy WebAssembly modules globally to our edge network with a single command.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Column: Animated Terminal UI -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center lg:justify-end perspective-1000\">\n\n            <!-- Terminal Container -->\n            <div class=\"w-full max-w-[560px] rounded-2xl bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/10 shadow-2xl relative flex flex-col z-10 overflow-hidden ring-1 ring-white/5 transform transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.01]\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n\n                <!-- Terminal Header -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5 border-b border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01]\">\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n                        <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#ef4444] border border-black/20\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#eab308] border border-black/20\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#22c55e] border border-black/20\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 tracking-widest uppercase font-medium\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Bash &ndash; omi-cli</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Terminal Body -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 h-[340px] text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed overflow-hidden relative\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n\n                    <div id=\"term-content\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <!-- Lines populated and animated by script below -->\n                        <div class=\"term-line opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300\">\n                            <span class=\"text-neutral-500 mr-3\">$</span><span class=\"text-neutral-200\">omi init cluster --region us-east</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"term-line opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 text-cyan-400 mt-5\">\n                            [i] Resolving topographical mesh...\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"term-line opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 text-neutral-400 mt-5 flex justify-between pr-4\">\n                            <span>Validating cryptographic signatures</span>\n                            <span>[OK]</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"term-line opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 text-neutral-400 flex justify-between pr-4\">\n                            <span>Allocating spatial runtime</span>\n                            <span>[OK]</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"term-line opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 mt-7\">\n                            <span class=\"text-neutral-500 mr-3\">$</span><span class=\"text-neutral-200\">omi deploy model_alpha.wasm</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"term-line opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 text-cyan-400 mt-5\">\n                            [i] Uploading to global edge nodes...\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Progress Bar Container -->\n                        <div class=\"term-line opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 mt-3 pr-4\">\n                            <div class=\"h-1.5 w-full bg-white/[0.08] rounded-full overflow-hidden relative\">\n                                <div id=\"cli-progress\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full bg-cyan-400 w-0 transition-all ease-out shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(34,211,238,0.8)] rounded-full\" style=\"transition-duration: 1.8s;\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"term-line opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 text-[#60a5fa] mt-6 tracking-wide drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(96,165,250,0.3)]\">\n                            SUCCESS: Logic mesh updated. Live in 14 regions.\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Inner terminal progressive blur overlay at bottom for scrolling illusion -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-16 pointer-events-none z-10\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to top, #0a0a0a 10%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Animation Logic -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const lines = document.querySelectorAll('.term-line');\n            const progress = document.getElementById('cli-progress');\n\n            // Animation timeline delays (in ms)\n            const delays = [500, 1500, 2200, 2600, 3600, 4600, 4800, 6800];\n\n            lines.forEach((line, index) => {\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    line.style.opacity = '1';\n\n                    // Trigger progress bar fill right after the uploading text appears\n                    if (index === 6) {\n                        setTimeout(() => {\n                            progress.style.width = '100%';\n                        }, 50);\n                    }\n                }, delays[index]);\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "integration-section.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/integration-section.jpg", "source_name": "integration-section-DESIGN.md", "views": 48, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T20:08:10.800286+00:00"}